      "text/html": [
       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The order fulfillment was partially successful. The A4 printer paper was fully fulfilled and invoiced, but</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">the cardstock order could not be completed due to a shortfall of 5 units. The inventory agent must be instructed to</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock these 5 units for the cardstock again before we can fulfill the remainder of the order. I will request the </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_agent to place a restock order for the shortage of 5 cardstock units as soon as possible for delivery by </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">April 15, 2025. Then I will prepare a final customer communication reflecting the partial fulfillment and restock </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">actions.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock_task = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Please place a restock order for the following item to fulfill the customer's outstanding order quantity, \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"requested on 2025-04-05, with delivery by 2025-04-15:\\n\" </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- High-quality recycled cardstock (various colors): 5 units\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"This is required because previous restock achieved only 495 units, with 5 units short of the customer's </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">request.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock_output = inventory_agent(task=restock_task, additional_args={})</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(restock_output)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
      ],
