       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The order_agent reports that only part of the order has been fulfilled because the A4 glossy paper restock</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">has not yet arrived, so 500 sheets cannot be fully supplied now. The other items (Matte, Colored, Recycled) have </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">been successfully fulfilled and are ready for delivery by April 15, 2025. The restock for glossy paper is expected </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">by the delivery date, so the customer should be informed about this partial fulfillment and the pending restock. I </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">will now compose the final customer-facing response following the provided template and instructions.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #79c0ff; text-decoration-color: #79c0ff; background-color: #0d1117; font-weight: bold\"># Compose final customer message using the gathered information:</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">request_type = \"order request\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">delivery_clause = f\", for delivery by {delivery_date}\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">items_section = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"You requested the following paper supplies:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"- A4 glossy paper x {requested_items['A4 glossy paper']}\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"- A4 matte paper x {requested_items['A4 matte paper']}\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"- A5 colored paper x {requested_items['A5 colored paper']}\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    f\"- A4 recycled paper x {requested_items['A4 recycled paper']}\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_section = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"We conducted a thorough inventory check and found the following availability:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- A4 glossy paper: 407 units available (requested: 500) — INSUFFICIENT\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- A4 matte paper: 9748 units available (requested: 1000) — SUFFICIENT\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- A5 colored paper: 2098 units available after restock (requested: 2000) — SUFFICIENT\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- A4 recycled paper: 9748 units available (requested: 3000) — SUFFICIENT\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">restock_section = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Restock orders have been placed for the following items:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- A5 colored paper: 1910 units ordered (estimated delivery: 2025-04-14)\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- A4 glossy paper: 240 units ordered (estimated delivery: 2025-04-15)\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Due to restocking schedules, fulfillment may be delayed beyond 2025-04-07.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">quote_section = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"We have prepared a quote for your order:\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Subtotal: $720.00\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Markup (35%): $252.00\\n\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"- Total: $972.00\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">fulfillment_section = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"The following items were fulfilled: A4 matte paper, A5 colored paper, A4 recycled paper. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"The A4 glossy paper item is pending restock and cannot be fulfilled at this time. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"We expect to complete your order once the restocked glossy paper arrives by April 15, 2025.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">closing_section = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"We appreciate your understanding and will keep you informed about the status of your order. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                 </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Should you have any questions or wish to adjust your order or delivery date, please do not hesitate to contact</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">us.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                               </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_message = f\"\"\"---</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Dear Customer,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thank you for your {request_type} dated {request_date}{delivery_clause}.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">{items_section}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">{inventory_section}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">{restock_section}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">{quote_section}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">{fulfillment_section}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">{closing_section}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Best regards,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                      </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #79c0ff; text-decoration-color: #79c0ff; background-color: #0d1117\">Munder Difflin Paper Company</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #79c0ff; text-decoration-color: #79c0ff; background-color: #0d1117\">---</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">\"\"\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">final_answer(final_message)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
