      "text/html": [
       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The request is an order for specific quantities of paper supplies with a delivery date specified. </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">According to the workflow for ORDER requests, I first need to check inventory with inventory_agent for the </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">requested items and quantities. If stock is insufficient, restock needs to be done before proceeding. After </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">       </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory confirmation, I will get a quote via quoting_agent, and finally fulfill the order with order_agent. I </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">will start by checking the inventory for \"500 sheets of A4 printing paper\" and \"200 sheets of cardstock,\" including</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">the delivery date and request date.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">inventory_response = inventory_agent(</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    task=\"Check current stock levels for the following items to fulfill an order: 500 sheets of A4 printing paper </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">and 200 sheets of cardstock. The requested delivery date is 2025-04-10 and the request date is 2025-04-08.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
