       "<pre style=\"white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',consolas,'Courier New',monospace\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic\">Output message of the LLM:</span> <span style=\"color: #d4b702; text-decoration-color: #d4b702\">────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">Thought: The inventory_agent confirms that no additional restocking is required for the high-quality glossy paper </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">since the current stock of 487 units already exceeds the pending shortfall of 13 units. This suggests there might </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\"> </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">have been a discrepancy in the previous fulfillment attempt or timing, and the 487 units should be sufficient to </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">fulfill the full order now. I will retry fulfilling the remaining quantity of 13 units for high-quality glossy </span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">    </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">paper with order_agent to complete the order fully.</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">&lt;code&gt;</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                             </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">retry_patch_quantity = 13</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                          </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">retry_order_task_description = (</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Retry fulfillment of 13 units of high-quality glossy paper to complete pending order for delivery by April 15,</span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">2025. \"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"Stock levels now confirm availability. Please record the transaction and update balance.\"</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                     </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">retry_order_input = {</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                              </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"items\": {\"high-quality glossy paper\": retry_patch_quantity},</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"request_date\": order_request_date,</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                            </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">    \"delivery_date\": order_delivery_date</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">}</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                  </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">retry_order_response = order_agent(task=retry_order_task_description, additional_args=retry_order_input)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">           </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"color: #e6edf3; text-decoration-color: #e6edf3; background-color: #0d1117\">print(retry_order_response)</span><span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                        </span>\n",
       "<span style=\"background-color: #0d1117\">                                                                                                                   </span>\n",
       "</pre>\n"
